# v43.5: precise, browser-only adult-content protection.
# Layer 1: Cloudflare Family DNS-over-HTTPS category filter blocks known adult
# hosts before a page can connect. It is scoped to Chrome, so Drive, KasmVNC,
# package installation and the Cloudflare tunnel keep their original DNS path.
# Layer 2: managed SafeSearch/Restricted Mode cannot be disabled in Chrome UI.
# Layer 3: a tiny local extension enforces strict mode on other major engines.
